### Outcome-Based Pricing Model
Instead of charging $2.00/minute, IntakeOps charges **$25 per qualified lead**. 
* **Client Cost:** $750/mo (for 30 leads)
* **Client Gain:** $13,500 in pipeline
* **ROI:** 18x
